    "title": "Coachella 2026 is expensive. But it's $1,000 less than this other fest",
    "text": "COACHELLACoachella 2026 is expensive. But it's $1,000 less than this other fest Brian BlueskyePalm Springs Desert SunMarch 27, 2026, 1:18 p.m. PTThe Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival is one of the hottest festival tickets every year — for both everyday music fans and big-name celebrities — but that kind of notoriety comes with a price.So how much does Coachella actually cost, and how does it compare to some of the country's other big music festivals like Lollapalooza, Austin City Limits, Bonnaroo and Summerfest? Each offers a version of the \"big festival\" experience with a different price structure. While some have the infrastructure and amenities of a city to make travel easier, others have a more rural setting that requires renting a vehicle and camping on-site.",
